			<div class="content" id="post-content-4761528">
									

<p>I definitely would've explored the historical context of the entity, but in a way it ties together with the theme of a &quot;god&quot; losing importance until it becomes just another animal for someone to experiment on.</p>
<p>I think elaborating on the appearance of the anomaly during times of progress would've accentuated your intent here, especially because I was confused as to whether or not the entity had a negative reaction to progress, or if it was triggering periods of technological progression.</p>
<p>Either way, I very much enjoyed this, and I'm looking forward to checking out the rest of your interconnected articles.</p>

